# Backend account: sends commands, reads every machine's events and status.
user backend
topic readwrite vending/#

# Machine accounts: username = machine code; each machine only touches its own topics (api-contract/mqtt-contract.md §8).
pattern read vending/%u/commands
pattern write vending/%u/events
pattern write vending/%u/status
pattern write vending/%u/heartbeat
pattern write vending/%u/telemetry
